   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>Hi Nimble experts,<div><br></div><div>I am trying to fit a locally smooth model, and I am wondering if this can be achieved in Nimble. The general idea of this model is to allow a large jump in the true values between adjacent areal units. Please see the attached picture for model description. Specifically, I am not sure if nimble allows the uniform prior has (-inf, inf). Thanks in advance!</div><div><br></div><div>The beta is a piecewise constant intercept that allows sudden jumps in the spatial surface between adjacent units. This constant intercept term has q distinct values, and if adjacent units are in different groups, their probability may have different values. Additionally, the number 1 before the semi-colon in the multinomial model indicates there is only &#39;one&#39; trail in the multinomial distribution, as each areal unit can only have one intercept term. I am also wondering if the multinomial prior can be achieved under Nimble. </div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/nimble-users/attach/380ac0edd4d7e/Model.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Model.png\" width=\"243\" height=\"142\" style=\"margin-right:0px\"><br></div><div><br></div><div>Many thanks</div><div>Best,</div><div>Alex</div><div><br></div><div><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\">Y</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\"> </span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\">(1)</span><br role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\">i</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\"> </span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\">∼</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\"> </span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\">Binomial</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\">(</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\">N</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\"> </span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\">(1)</span><br role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\">i</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\"> </span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\">, p</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\">(1)</span><br role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\">i</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\"> </span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\">)</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\"> </span></div><div><br></div><div><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\">Y</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\"> </span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\">(1)</span><br role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\">i</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\"> </span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\">∼</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" styl