ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:7.35802px;font-family:sans-serif\"> </span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\">)</span><span role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;white-space:pre;font-size:11.0371px;font-family:sans-serif\"> </span></div></div>\r\n"
